    sql_parse.c/.h      the lexer and statement pre-classifier
    sql_parse_lime.h    the token/parser glue header
    vexec.c/.h          the vectorized executor

  Engine facade and storage
    engine.c/.h     the sx_ facade -- the engine boundary
    xstore.c/.h     catalog, MVCC record store, isolation, SSI, native
                    transaction / DDL / scan APIs
